      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——其中，某篇每月连载的专栏很值得一读。\n我每次都会对此心怀期待地取来报纸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e27613cd1e78bf153c209684e6f82c1e79a75b718695de538bee89a0c27e90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
